📜 Privacy Policy

Last updated: January 2026

This Privacy Policy describes how Odia Calendar (“we”, “our”, or “us”) collects, uses, and protects user information when you use the Odia Calendar / Odia Panji mobile application (“App”).

By using this App, you agree to the terms of this Privacy Policy.

1. Information We Collect
a) Personal Information

We do not collect, store, or require any personal information, such as:

Name

Email address

Phone number

Address

Login credentials

The App works without user registration.

b) Non-Personal Information

We may collect limited, non-identifiable information to improve app performance, such as:

Device type

Operating system version

App usage statistics (screens visited, crashes)

This data cannot be used to identify you personally.

2. Calendar & Panchanga Data

All calendar, Panchanga, and festival information shown in the App:

Is static or preloaded

Comes from traditional Odia Panjika sources

Is not linked to any user data

3. Notifications

The App may send local notifications for:

Ekadashi

Festivals

Reminders set by the user

These notifications:

Are generated locally on your device

Do not send any data to our servers

Can be disabled anytime in device settings

4. Analytics (Optional)

We may use privacy-friendly analytics tools (such as Apple App Analytics or Google Firebase) to understand:

App usage trends

Feature performance

Crash reports

All analytics data is:

Aggregated

Anonymous

Used only for improving the App

5. Advertisements (If Applicable)

If the App displays ads:

Third-party ad providers may collect non-personal information

Ads comply with Apple App Store policies

No personally identifiable data is shared by us

You can remove ads by:

Turning off ad personalization (device-level)

Using ad-free versions (if available)

6. Third-Party Services

The App may include:

PDF viewers

Analytics tools

Advertisement services

These third parties have their own privacy policies, and we recommend reviewing them.

7. Data Security

We take reasonable steps to protect information by:

Avoiding personal data collection

Using secure app frameworks

Following platform security best practices

However, no method of transmission over the internet is 100% secure.

8. Children’s Privacy

This App is safe for all age groups.
We do not knowingly collect any data from children under 13.

9. Changes to This Policy

We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time.
Any changes will be posted on this page with an updated date.

